Additional notes (not part of the licence grant):

* This is a reporting tool, not a medical device. Every report must be checked
  and approved by the responsible doctor before it is given to a patient. The
  default test ranges are starting values that the laboratory's doctor must
  review.
* The name "K.D.S. Pathology" and its logo identify a real laboratory and are
  not licensed for use by others. Replace them with your own in Settings.
* Third-party components (for example Electron, Chromium, pdf.js, qrcode,
  fflate, cfb, electron-updater, pino and Baileys) keep their own licences.
  Baileys is an unofficial WhatsApp Web library; using it may breach
  WhatsApp's terms, and you use it at your own risk.
